  "prefLabel": "Fors 101.01 Purpose and Scope",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-02-05",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fors 101.01 Purpose and Scope. The rules of this title implement the statutory responsibilities of the New Hampshire board of licensure for foresters created by RSA 310-A:100 and shall be binding upon every licensed forester and person practicing forestry for compensation.\n\nSource. #5222, eff 9-11-91; EXPIRED 9-11-97\n\nNew. #6597, INTERIM, eff 10-8-97, EXPIRED: 2-5-98\n\nNew. #6915, eff 12-22-98",
